  "description": "DOBQEU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H48 Cl7 Eu6 N48 O6,0.23(Cl1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 2 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.874-4.311 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.49-135.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu6(μ6-Cl)0.23(μ3-O0.77)4(μ3-O)2.6(μ3-Cl)0.4Cl6(μ2-4-NH2-1,2,4-triaz)12]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
